  m_text: "The circulatory system is the body\u2019s transport system. It is made
    up of the heart, blood, and blood vessels. The heart pumps blood throughout the
    body, carrying oxygen, nutrients, and hormones to cells and removing carbon dioxide
    and other wastes. Blood travels through arteries, veins, and capillaries. The
    circulatory system helps maintain body temperature, supports the immune system,
    and keeps all organs supplied with the substances they need to function properly."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
